OL,3,GNEWSABarge tradition revived in Lord
OL,4,AMayor's show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new Lord Mayor of the City of
OL,7,FLondon will travel along the Thames by
OL,8,Fbarge on Saturday, reviving a
OL,9,Fcenturies-old tradition before the
OL,10,Fannual Lord Mayor's Show, as artists
OL,11,Fput the finishing touches to the
OL,12,Fflotilla.
OL,14,FLord Mayor Bronek Masojada will leave
OL,15,FWestminster at 08:30 GMT aboard the
OL,16,Fceremonial barge Jubilant, followed by
OL,17,Fa flotilla of livery company boats,
OL,18,Fbefore coming ashore at HMS President.
OL,20,FThe barge journey echoes the route Lord
OL,21,FMayors once took to Westminster to
OL,22,Fswear loyalty to the Crown.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
