OL,3,GNEWSABarge tradition revived in Lord
OL,4,AMayor's show
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 6,500 people, 250 horses and more
OL,7,Fthan 50 floats, including a replica of
OL,8,FTower Bridge with rising bascules -
OL,9,Fmovable sections of road - are to be
OL,10,Finvolved in the event.
